  "question": {
    "text": "<p>According to Bohr&#39;s atomic theory:<br />(A) Kinetic energy of electron is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math><br />(B) The product of velocity (v) of electron and principal quantum number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>'</mo><mo>vn</mo><mo>'</mo><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo></math><br />(C) Frequency of revolution of electron in an orbit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math><br />(D) Coulombic force of attraction on the electron is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
